      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, sorry, can you skip the analogies and just give me the technical specifics on the interlocking patterns? i need to know exactly how to orient the pallets to minimize shifting during transport. also, how does the vertical center of gravity change if we use those interlocking layers versus column stacking?",
